 * v2.0
 * ```
 * double ::= D(x44) b7 b6 b5 b4 b3 b2 b1 b0
 *        ::= x5b
 *        ::= x5c
 *        ::= x5d(byte) b0
 *        ::= x5e(short) b1 b0
 *        ::= x5f(float) b3 b2 b1 b0
